#: ../../../install.rst:212
msgid "System package"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install.rst:214
msgid ""
"Various operating system distributions provide platform-specific package "
"managers that may offer a xonsh package. This approach is **not "
"recommended** for the following reasons:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install.rst:217
msgid ""
"On non-rolling-release operating systems, the xonsh version is often "
"outdated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install.rst:218
msgid "The package may be missing important dependencies."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install.rst:219
msgid ""
"System package managers install xonsh into the system Python environment, "
"which means that any significant system update or change has a high "
"probability of breaking the shell."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install.rst:221
msgid "**Arch Linux:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install.rst:223
msgid "$ pacman -S xonsh  # not recommended but possible"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install.rst:227
msgid "**Debian/Ubuntu:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install.rst:229
msgid "$ apt install xonsh  # not recommended but possible"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install.rst:233
msgid "**Fedora:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install.rst:235
msgid "$ dnf install xonsh  # not recommended but possible"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install.rst:239
msgid "**GNU guix:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install.rst:241
msgid "$ guix install xonsh  # not recommended but possible"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install.rst:245
msgid "**macOS:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install.rst:247
msgid "$ brew install xonsh  # not recommended but possible"
msgstr ""

